  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 615.08 Fines Relating to Emergency or Immediate Response Actions for Hazardous Waste Discharges",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 615.08 Fines Relating to Emergency or Immediate Response Actions for Hazardous Waste Discharges. For failing to conduct emergency or immediate response actions in accordance with Env-Or 605.02, the proposed fine shall be $2,000 per violation.\n\nSource. #14419, eff 11-4-25, EXPIRES: 11-4-35",
